From c0025f03fd2212e6dd1c80a0411eb29b4710bf21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cristian Papa <pcristian292@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 14:32:20 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: use the shipping WAN QDMA thresholds on EN751221

With the 4096-descriptor forwarding profile, the EN751221 WAN QDMA gets
a PSE buffer threshold of 20/192 (channel/total) and dynamic congestion
minimums of 2048 (total) and the auto channel value. The shipping
firmware of the Archer XR500v runs its WAN QDMA with 32/128 and
minimums of 819 and 160: /proc/qdma_wan/debug in steady state, and
TXQ_DYN_TOTALTHR 0x3c000333, TXQ_DYN_CHNLTHR 0x3c0000a0 and
TXQ_DYN_QUEUETHR 0x03330018.

Use those values. Less upstream traffic then queues ahead of the GPON
MAC, which shows up as lower latency while the upload is saturated.

Measured on the XR500v over its GPON WAN, with eight TCP flows
uploading to a speedtest server 3 ms away and 10 pings per second to
the same server, four runs of 10 s each:

  before: 718-721 Mbit/s, average ping 6.0-6.1 ms
  after:  711-714 Mbit/s, average ping 3.3-3.5 ms

That is about 1 % of upload throughput for 45 % less latency under
load. Download throughput and latency, and Wi-Fi results, did not
change. The LAN QDMA and the reduced-pool fallback are not touched.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Cristian Papa <pcristian292@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
index a2079ab23..18b859d9a 100644
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
@@ -1576,8 +1576,8 @@ static void econet_init_en751221_qdma(struct airoha_qdma_mips *qdma)
 		val |= FIELD_PREP(EN751221_PSE_BUF_CH_THR_MASK, 16) |
 		       FIELD_PREP(EN751221_PSE_BUF_TOTAL_THR_MASK, 128);
 	} else {
-		val |= FIELD_PREP(EN751221_PSE_BUF_CH_THR_MASK, 20) |
-		       FIELD_PREP(EN751221_PSE_BUF_TOTAL_THR_MASK, 192);
+		val |= FIELD_PREP(EN751221_PSE_BUF_CH_THR_MASK, 32) |
+		       FIELD_PREP(EN751221_PSE_BUF_TOTAL_THR_MASK, 128);
 	}
 	econet_wreg(val, &qdma->regs->buf_usage_cfg);
 
@@ -1628,8 +1628,9 @@ static void econet_init_en751221_qdma(struct airoha_qdma_mips *qdma)
 		queue_max = 204;
 	} else if (qdma->fwd_buf_size == 2048 && qdma->qdma->id == 1 &&
 		   qdma->num_fwd_descs == 4096) {
-		total_min = 2048;
+		total_min = 819;
 		total_max = 15360;
+		channel_min = 160;
 		channel_max = 15360;
 		queue_max = 819;
 	}
